SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Unemployment Insurance Weekly Claims Report
DESCRIPTION:In the week ending September 12\, the advance figure for seaso
 nally adjusted initial claims was 196\,000\, a decrease of 10\,000 from th
 e previous week's unrevised level of 206\,000. The 4-week moving average w
 as 203\,250\, a decrease of 2\,750 from the previous week's unrevised aver
 age of 206\,000.\nhttp://www.dol.gov/newsroom/releases/eta/eta20260917
